## Life as a Vampire

After the attack, the crew of the Reed, minus Little Reed/Oca
<br> instinctually navigated to the closest shore where they
<br> fed on more humans than they could process.
<br> After loosing one in the traumatising attack, 
<br> Nehy started looking out in the water for those
<br> to "save," like they had saved Little Reed.
<br> He helped ports while Nebra searched for 
<br> Little Reed. 
<br> They supplied food and shelter to places ransacked 
<br> by pillages. They helped fixed homes in the evening hours
<br> and fished with the residents. 
<br> On the occasions where Nehy couldn't save someone, he 
<br> turned them, creating Jeru and Nehy's group of 
<br> fledglings coined "The Drowned." 

